# Used by `npm run fake-auction:remote` (tools/fake-auction.ts --remote) to
# connect to a remote Prosody instance (e.g. the one deployed on Render)
# instead of localhost. Also read directly by `npm run test:integration`
# when set, to run that suite against the same remote Prosody. See
# poc/docs/deploy.md.
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the real values.
XMPP_SERVICE_URL=wss://host/xmpp-websocket
XMPP_DOMAIN=host
